<title>USA: Indosat at 27 in New York on Wednesday.</title>
<headline>Indosat at 27 in New York on Wednesday.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>PT Indonesian Satellite Corporation (Indosat) closed at 27 in New York on Wednesday. It recorded the day's low of 26-3/4 and the day's high of 27-1/2.</p>
<p>Volume was 128,200 American Depository Shares. Block volume was 63,100. Its previous close on Tuesday was 26-3/4.</p>
<p>One ADS represents 10 common shares.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
</text>
